title: "Methodological Flexibility in the Iowa Gambling Task Undermines Interpretability: A Meta-method Review"
abstract: "Data and code accompanying the article \"Methodological Flexibility in the Iowa Gambling Task Undermines Interpretability: A Meta-method Review\" (Külpmann, Ries, Hussey & Elson), accepted for publication in Advances in Methods and Practices in Psychological Science (AMPPS). Includes the sampling process, codebooks, meta-methods review data, inter-rater reliability, the IGT scoring multiverse analysis, and supplementary materials."
